    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 475,000\n\nThis is a detached home of some 182 sqm on a site of approximately 0.77 acres. On the ground floor is the kitchen/dining area and a separate living room with bay window and stove with back boiler. To the other side of the house are two double bedrooms, one with en-suite and walk in wardrobe, a study/small bedroom and family bathroom. Upstairs are three generous bedrooms, one with an en-suite, along with the family shower room.\nTo the front of the house is a shady veranda and to the rear are a store room, workshop and gazebo.\nIn terms of location Murntown Village with pre-school and national school, shop, church and pub, is just 4.5 km away, Wexford Town is 12 km and the beautiful amenity of Johnstown Castle is just 6.5 km. If beaches and coastline are more your thing the ever popular Kilmore Quay is approximately 10 km away.\nThis is a great family home that has been a happy place for the current owners for many years.\nHouse built 2001, faces in a SE (front)/NW (rear) direction, mains water, OFCH and back boiler, septic tank."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.3m x 2.7m\nwith tiled floor, windows in front doors can be opened, 2m wide storage area/hot press with part hanging/part shelved\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 4.3m\nwith tiled floor, stove with back boiler, built-in storage, bay window\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.3m x 4.5m\ndouble aspect room with tiled floor and backsplash, waist and eye level units, eye-level ovens and microwave, patio doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.5m x 2m\nwith tiled flooring and splashback, waist and eye level units, sink, rear window and rear door\n\nRear Corridor - 4.8m x 1m\nwith tiled flooring, daido rail, large storage area to the rear (1m x 0.6m)\n\nBathroom 1 - 3.2m x 1.9m\nwith tiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB and bath\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.2m\nwith laminate flooring, en-suite and walk-in wardrobe\n\nEn-Suite - 1.7m x 1.6m\nwith tiled floor and shower surround, WC, WHB and mains shower\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 1.6m x 1.4m\nwith shelving and hanging space\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.5m\nwith laminate flooring and 1.5m wide wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m x 3m\ncurrently laid out as study, with laminate flooring\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 4.1m x 3m\ntimber staircase in the middle of the landing, timber flooring, attic hatch and front-facing window\n\nBedroom 4 - 5m x 4.7m\nwith timber flooring, dormer window and skylight, built in wardrobes. En-suite room\n\nEn-Suite - 1.8m x 1.6m\nwith tiled flooring, shower surround and part-tiled walls. WC, WHB in vanity, electric shower\n\nBathroom 2 - 2.1m x 1.8m\nwith tiled flooring and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB and bath. Skylight\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.7m x 3.5m\nwith timber flooring, triple wardrobe and skylight\n\nBedroom 6 - 4.3m x 3.8m\nwith timber flooring and front-facing window\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nVeranda - 5m x 1.6m\na nice shady spot to the front of the house with decked flooring\n\nGazebo - \nlovely area to relax\n\nStore - 5.3m x 2.6m\nwith doors rear and side, side window, part tiled floor\n\nWorkshop - 7.1m x 6.4m\nwith concrete flooring, windows to the side, front and rear\n\n"
      },
